%!PS
% SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 EfterScript contributors
% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
% oracle: colour
% Scenario: Background applies in pattern use only. One axial shading
% with a Background is painted with shfill inside a clip and, as a
% pattern, fills a rectangle wider than its extent: the shading is one
% resource carrying the background, the shade operation is what ignores
% it, and the pattern honours it outside the blend.
/Sh << /ShadingType 2 /ColorSpace /DeviceRGB /Coords [100 0 200 0]
   /Background [0.9 0.9 0.2]
   /Function << /FunctionType 2 /Domain [0 1] /C0 [0 0 0.6] /C1 [0.8 0 0] /N 1 >> >> def
gsave
0 500 translate
50 0 300 100 rectclip
Sh shfill
grestore
/P << /PatternType 2 /Shading Sh >> matrix makepattern def
P setpattern
50 300 300 100 rectfill
showpage
